lack room with blood-red panes and a giant ebony clock that chimes hourly, halting all music and dance. As midnight strikes, a mysterious figure appears dressed as the Red Death itself, drenched in blood and wearing a corpse-like mask, terrifying the guests and provoking the prince’s rage; when Prospero pursues the figure with a dagger through all seven rooms, the figure turns in the black chamber, and Prospero collapses dead—revealing the figure to be an empty shell, as the plague has infiltrated even the most fortified sanctuary, claiming every life as the lights fade and darkness claims all.</div>\n   792→                \n   793→                \n   794→                <div class=\"chapter-characters\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem;\">\n   795→                    <strong style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; color: var(--muted);\">Characters:</strong>\n   796→                    \n   797→                    <span class=\"tag\">Prince Prospero</span>\n   798→                    \n   799→                    <span class=\"tag\">The masked figure (Red Death)</span>\n   800→                    \n   801→                    <span class=\"tag\">Courtiers</span>\n   802→                    \n   803→                    <span class=\"tag\">Musicians</span>\n   804→                    \n   805→                    <span class=\"tag\">Buffoons</span>\n   806→                    \n   807→                    <span class=\"tag\">Improvisatori</span>\n   808→                    \n   809→                    <span class=\"tag\">Ballet-dancers</span>\n   810→                    \n   811→                    <span class=\"tag\">Beauty</span>\n   812→                    \n   813→                    \n   814→                </div>\n   815→                \n   816→            </div>\n   817→            \n   818→        </section>\n   819→        </div>\n   820→\n   821→        <div id=\"characters\" class=\"tab-content\">\n   822→        <section>\n   823→            <h2>👥 Character Guide</h2>\n  