\n            :root {\n                --bg: #f5f5f5;\n                --surface: #fff;\n                --surface-alt: #f9f9f9;\n                --primary: #e0e0e0;\n                --accent: #d32f2f;\n                --accent-soft: #e57373;\n                --text: #333;\n                --muted: #666;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <nav>\n            <a href=\"#overview\" class=\"tab-link\" data-tab=\"overview\">Overview</a>\n            <a href=\"#chapters\" class=\"tab-link\" data-tab=\"chapters\">Chapters</a>\n            <a href=\"#characters\" class=\"tab-link\" data-tab=\"characters\">Characters</a>\n            <a href=\"#pronunciations\" class=\"tab-link\" data-tab=\"pronunciations\">Pronunciations</a>\n            \n        </nav>\n\n        <div id=\"overview\" class=\"tab-content active\">\n            <header>\n                <h1>Masque of the Red Death - Poe</h1>\n                <p class=\"meta\">\n                    by Edgar Allan Poe &middot; \n                    Narrator's Guide &middot; Generated 2026-01-18 23:23\n                </p>\n                \n                <p class=\"meta\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem;\">\n                    Analyzed with qwen3:30b-instruct\n                     in \n                    6m 0s\n                </p>\n                \n\n                \n                <p class=\"meta\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted);\">\n                    <strong>Started:</strong> Jan 18, 2026 at 11:17 PM &middot;\n                    <strong>Ended:</strong> Jan 18, 2026 at 11:23 PM\n                </p>\n                \n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"stats\">\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"value\">2,449</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">Words</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"value\">0h 16m</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">Est. Duration</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"value\">1</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">Chapters</div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"value\">0</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">Main Characters</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"value\">75</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">Pronunciation Notes</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            \n            <section>\n                <h2>📚 Book Structure</h2>\n                \n                <p style=\"margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.8;\">This book contains 1 chapters. Chapters are numbered sequentially.</p>\n                \n                \n            </section>\n\n            \n            <section>\n                <h2>📖 Plot Summary</h2>\n                <div style=\"margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The story begins in a time of widespread terror as the Red Death—a merciless plague characterized by violent symptoms and fatal scarlet stains—sweeps across the land, leaving death and despair in its wake. Amid the chaos, Prince Prospero, a man of extravagant tastes and unyielding arrogance, chooses to defy the inevitable by retreating with a thousand courtiers into the secluded, fortified abbey he has transformed into a sanctuary of luxury and excess. Sealed off from the outside world with iron gates and heated furnaces, the abbey becomes a self-contained realm of opulence, where the elite indulge in revelry and illusion, attempting to escape the grim reality beyond their walls. The prince, obsessed with control and pleasure, orchestrates a grand masked ball, hosted in seven intricately themed chambers, each adorned with stained-glass windows that reflect their distinct colors, culminating in a final, ominous black chamber with blood-red panes and a towering ebony clock that chimes each hour, silencing all merriment with its somber toll.\n\nAs the night progresses, the atmosphere grows increasingly tense, despite the festivities. The clock’s chimes serve as a grim reminder of time’s relentless march, and the guests, though masked and disguised, are haunted by an undercurrent of dread. The turning point arrives at midnight, when a mysterious figure appears—dressed as the Red Death itself, draped in blood and wearing a corpse-like mask. The figure moves silently through the seven chambers, inciting terror and disbelief. Prince Prospero, enraged by the intrusion and the violation of his sanctuary, draws a dagger and pursues the phantom through the rooms, driven by fury and a desperate need to reclaim control. The chase leads them into the black chamber, where the figure finally turns to face him—revealing not a living man, but an empty shell, a hollow embodiment of the plague that has infiltrated even the most fortified refuge.\n\nIn that moment, Prospero collapses dead, and the truth dawns on the horrified guests: the Red Death was never an intruder—it was the inevitable consequence of their denial and arrogance. The plague had already claimed them all, and the figure was merely a manifestation of their collective fate. As the lights flicker and fade, the final chamber is consumed by darkness, and every soul within the abbey perishes, their lives extinguished in silence. The story ends with the complete annihilation of the isolated elite, underscoring the futility of attempting to escape death through wealth, power, or isolation. The narrative concludes not with triumph, but with the chilling realization that no sanctuary, no matter how secure, can withstand the universal reach of mortality.</div>\n                \n                <p style=\"margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--muted);\">\n                    <strong>Themes:</strong> identity, ambition, loss\n                </p>\n                \n            </section>\n            \n\n            \n            <section>\n                <h2>🤖 Analysis Models</h2>\n                <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 1rem; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary);\">\n                            <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted);\">Phase</th>\n                            <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted);\">Model</th>\n                            <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted);\">Provider</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        \n                        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--primary);\">\n                            <td style=\"padding: 0.75rem;\">Chapter Detection</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace;\">qwen3:30b-instruct</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 0.75rem;\">ollama</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        \n                        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--primary);\">\n                            <td style=\"padding: 0.75rem;\">Character Extraction</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace;\">qwen3-next:80b-a3b-instruct-q8_0</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 0.75rem;\">ollama</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        \n                        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--primary);\">\n                            <td style=\"padding: 0.75rem;\">Chapter Summaries</td>\n                            <td style=\"padding: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace;\">qwen3-next:80b-a3b-instruct-q